<title>DENMARK: ISS completes Darenas sale to Unilever.</title>
<headline>ISS completes Darenas sale to Unilever.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish cleaning group International Service  System (ISS) said on Friday its ISS Scandinavia A/S unit completed  the sale of ISS Darenas International to Unilever's DiverseyLever  subsidiary.</p>
<p>ISS Darenas was ISS's Danish supply house for cleaning products, machinery  and equipment, ISS said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said that DiverseyLever had well-established commercial links with  Darenas.</p>
<p>In June, ISS announced that it signed a letter of content regarding  the sale. No financial details were announced.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
